x":6,"y":5,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Salt has gone up again; it costs me a third more to buy in than last month. I can't help it. If it's too dear, buy less.","zh":"盐又涨了，进价比上个月高了三成。我也没办法，你要是嫌贵，就少买点。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Have a look, take your time. Don't ask for lamp oil, though. Not a drop has come in this month, and every house is short.","zh":"要什么随便看。灯油就别问了，这个月一滴都没进来，家家都缺。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The fort has been taking men again. Both the neighbours' sons went last month, and there hasn't been a letter since.","zh":"要塞又来征人了。隔壁家两个儿子上个月都走了，到现在一封信也没有。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/food/bread","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/food/bread","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/food/bread","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s1.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s1.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s1.3","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/material/cloth","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s2.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/material/cloth","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s2.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4"}},{"type":"item/light/torch","id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk4.s3.0",