n I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Rain. Good. Walk round, would you, and don't step in the furrows I just opened.","zh":"下雨了，好。你绕着点走，别踩我刚开的沟。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The wheat came into ear nearly half a month late this year, and the ears are thin. My father farmed forty years and says he never saw the like.","zh":"今年的麦子抽穗晚了快半个月，穗子也瘪。我爹种了四十年地，说从没见过这样的。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The wolves have been bold this year. They took three of our sheep last month, and we've raised the fence again.","zh":"今年的狼胆子大，上个月叼走了我们三只羊。篱笆我们又加高了一截。"}}]}}},{"id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk13.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk13"}},{"id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk13.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk13"}},{"id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk13.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk13"}},{"id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk14","type":"actor/person/child","name":{"en":"Svetla Redwell","zh":"斯韦特拉·赤井"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"redmarch.spearholm.home-6","x":4,"y":1},"facing":"down","props":{"age":7,"household":"redmarch.spearholm.h6","purse":1,"favourite":"item/food/egg/boiled"},"tags":["minor"],"contents":["redmarch.spearholm.folk14.coin0"],"look":{"body":"girl","parts":{"hair":"hair.childbob","face":"face.child","outfit":"outfit.smock","legs":"legs.stockings","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"black","eyes":"amber","outfit.1":"woad","legs.1":"indigo","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"child","schedule":[{"from":20,"to":7,"map":"redmarch.spearholm.home-6","x":4,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"redmarch.spearholm","x":19,"y":10,"activity":"play"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"redmarch.spearholm.home-6","x":3,"y":2,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"redmarch.spearholm","x":19,"y":10,"activity":"play"},{"from":18,"to":20,"map":"redmarch.spearholm","x":14,"y":20,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"hour:evening","text":{"en":"I have to go home, Mum's calling me for supper. I'm not tired. I'm really not.","zh":"我得回家了，我娘喊我吃饭。我不困，真的不困。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"My mum says I can't go out after dark because something out there takes children. Have you ever seen one?","zh":"我娘说天黑了不许出门，外面有东西会把小孩叼走。你见过那种东西吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The fort has been taking men again. Both the neighbours' sons went last month, and there hasn't been a letter since.","zh":"要塞又来征人了。隔壁家两个儿子上个月都走了，到现在一封信也没有。"}}]}}},{"id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk14.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.spearholm.folk14"}},{"id":"redmarch.spearholm.folk15","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Svetla Rustdale","zh":"斯韦特拉·锈谷"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"redmarch.spearholm","x":34,"y":24},"facing":"down","props":{"age":30,"household":"redmarch.spearholm.h7","purse":4,"favourite":"item/food/berries"},"contents":["redmarch.spearholm.folk15.coin0","redmarch.spearholm.folk15.coin1","redmarch.spearholm.folk15.coin2","redmarch.spearholm.folk15.coin3"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.bun","face":"face.soft","hat":"hat.straw","outfit":"outfit.workdress","legs":"legs.hose","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"black","eyes":"bark","hat.1":"mustard","outfit.1":"undyed","outfit.2":"linen","legs.1":"undyed","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":6,"map":"redmarch.spearholm.home-7","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"redmarch.spearholm","x":34,"y":24,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"redmarch.spearholm.home-7","x":6,"y":5,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"redmarch.spearholm","x":34,"y":24,"